from edit import *
q=load(23);p=part(q,'q2');rep(p['rationale']['correct'],'en','He denied suicidal intent and plan, so the nurse monitors and reassesses rather than jumping to an involuntary hold.','He denied intent to hurt himself, but assessment of a plan and access to means remains necessary. Continue safety assessment and reassessment; the first statement alone does not establish the disposition.');rep(p['rationale']['correct'],'zh','他否认自杀意图和计划，因此护士应监测并重新评估，而不是直接做非自愿留观。','他否认伤害自己的意图，但仍需评估有无计划及可接触的手段。应继续开展并重复安全评估；仅凭最初表述不能确定处置方式。');bi(obj(p['rationale']['byChoice'],'d','refId'),'Explore the statement and assess suicidal thoughts, intent, plan, access to means, and protective factors. Denial of intent alone does not establish safety or justify assuming that a plan was denied.','应探询这句话，并评估自杀想法、意图、计划、可接触的手段及保护因素。仅否认意图并不能确定安全，也不能据此假定患者否认了计划。');anchor(p,'stage_1')
c=content(q,1);rep(c,'en','resume buprenorphine/naloxone 16 mg/4 mg sublingual daily tonight','continue buprenorphine/naloxone 16 mg/4 mg sublingual daily, with the next dose tomorrow morning at the usual time because today’s morning dose was already taken');rep(c,'zh','今晚恢复丁丙诺啡/纳洛酮 16 mg/4 mg 舌下每日一次','继续丁丙诺啡/纳洛酮 16 mg/4 mg 舌下每日一次，因今晨已服药，下一剂为明早通常服药时间')
c=content(q,2);rep(c,'en','He took the evening buprenorphine/naloxone dose 30 minutes ago and has taken acetaminophen and ibuprofen as scheduled.','Medication reconciliation confirms that today’s buprenorphine/naloxone dose was taken this morning; the next prescribed dose is tomorrow morning. He has taken acetaminophen and ibuprofen as scheduled.');rep(c,'zh','他 30 分钟前服用了晚间丁丙诺啡/纳洛酮，并按时服用了对乙酰氨基酚和布洛芬。','用药核对确认他已于今晨服用今日丁丙诺啡/纳洛酮，下一次医嘱剂量为明早。他已按时服用对乙酰氨基酚和布洛芬。')
p=part(q,'q5');rep(obj(p['options'],'e'),'en','Review naloxone with Marcus and Tanya:','With Marcus’s permission to include Tanya, review naloxone with them:');rep(obj(p['options'],'e'),'zh','与 Marcus 和 Tanya 复习纳洛酮：','在获得 Marcus 同意让 Tanya 参与后，与两人复习纳洛酮：');rep(p['rationale']['correct'],'en','naloxone/overdose teaching with Tanya.','naloxone/overdose teaching with Tanya if he consents to her participation.');rep(p['rationale']['correct'],'zh','并与 Tanya 复习纳洛酮/过量宣教。','并在其同意 Tanya 参与后，与两人复习纳洛酮/过量宣教。');anchor(p,'stage_3');save(q)
q=load(24);p=part(q,'q4');bi(obj(p['options'],'q4_a'),'Coordinate prescribed analgesia with physical therapy or transfers, reassess pain, sedation and orthostatic symptoms before mobilizing, and use pillows and distraction to support participation.','将医嘱镇痛与物理治疗或转移时间协调，活动前复评疼痛、镇静程度及体位性症状，并用枕头支撑和转移注意力来促进配合。');bi(obj(p['rationale']['byChoice'],'q4_a','refId'),'Pain control and nonpharmacologic support can enable mobility, but this client’s earlier sedation and orthostatic symptoms require reassessment before transfer.','镇痛及非药物支持可帮助活动，但患者先前曾出现嗜睡及体位性症状，因此转移前必须复评。');anchor(p,'stage_2');save(q)
